# Admin inner pages (Create Event + Ghost)

When editing Create Event or Ghost admin UI, **Figma is the source of truth**. Do not invent a new layout.

## Scope

- **In scope:** Create Event wizard (steps 1–4), Ghost Content table, Ghost Create Action form.
- **Out of scope:** Admin shell (sidebar, header, theme toggle wiring). Do not restyle other admin list pages.

## Figma

File: [9RMXZrqarVf6A3t4Lug70v](https://www.figma.com/design/9RMXZrqarVf6A3t4Lug70v) — page **11 — Admin**.

Pull Dark **and** Light via Figma MCP before coding:

| Screen | Dark | Light |
|--------|------|-------|
| Create Event Step 1 — Event | `464:2` | `464:153` |
| Create Event Step 2 — Access | `466:2` | pair |
