## Must match

- **Create Event:** full-page wizard in main content (not a translucent overlay on the events table); stepper + progress; category **chips**; proper map height + pin; sticky Cancel / Next footer.
- **Ghost Content:** columns story · event · engagement · posted · Edit/Delete; Delete = danger red (not primary orange).
- **Create Action:** centered ~640px form; action-type chips; constrained fields (no full-bleed giant inputs).
- **Theme:** both Dark + Light via existing admin theme tokens (`#FF6B35`, dark `#0D1117`/`#161B22`, light `#F6F8FA`/`#FFFFFF`). Never hardcode dark-only.

## Don’t

- Invent layout or restyle the whole admin nav.
- Keep the old broken create-event overlay.
- Change APIs/data wiring — UI structure only unless asked.
